  "comments": [
    {"at":0,"placement":"line","text":"Mirrored copy for facing 1. Slot order: row 1 takes parts 2,1,0, row 2 parts 5,4,3, row 3 parts 8,7,6 (columns exchanged). Each part goes through shape_copy_mirrored_part with the store bases destination-2, destination and destination+2."},
    {"at":24,"placement":"side","text":"Third store base = destination + 2"},
    {"at":38,"placement":"side","text":"First store base = destination - 2"},
    {"at":83,"placement":"side","text":"Next 64-byte sprite: all three store bases + $40"},
    {"at":632,"placement":"line","text":"Copies part A mirrored: source $8000 + part*64 via $7f00 and shape_part_lo. For each of the 21 lines it exchanges bytes 0 and 2 and mirrors each byte with $7e00 (pixel pairs reversed). It copies 63 bytes. Called 9 times from shape_build_mirrored."},
    {"at":672,"placement":"side","text":"Base destination-2: source byte 2 goes to byte 0"},
    {"at":682,"placement":"side","text":"Base destination: byte 1 stays"},
    {"at":692,"placement":"side","text":"Base destination+2: source byte 0 goes to byte 2"}
  ],
